//               signal spam filters, volume/candle pattern filters, and visual enhancements
//   v3.0-v3.9 - Projection system: Added comprehensive price projection with target/stop loss lines, real-time success tracking,
//               and major performance optimizations (60-80% improvement)
//   v4.0-v4.2 - Code simplification: Removed projection visuals, enhanced bounce detection with EMA invalidation logic,
//               streamlined codebase for cleaner performance
//   v4.3 - UI improvements: Enhanced status row with intuitive emojis (✅❌), removed unused code, and improved debugging capabilities
//   v4.4Beta - Performance consolidation: Consolidated all performance toggles into single toggle for simplified user experience
//   v4.4Beta - Fixed trend/counter-trend classification logic to properly handle RANGING/MIXED market structures
//   v4.4Beta - Enhanced market structure display with trend direction descriptions (UP/DOWN/SIDEWAYS)
//   v4.4Beta - Simplified pivot row display by removing statistical information but keeping trade suggestions
//   v4.4Beta - Simplified bounce row display by removing statistical information but keeping trade suggestions
//   v4.4Beta - Further simplified pivot, bounce, and market rows by removing bar count information
//   v4.4Beta - Added emojis to trade direction suggestions for better visual clarity
